  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Gaseous Blast\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" title=\"Image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Unknown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Causes poison damage over time.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Emits a fetid cloud that causes Poison Damage over time to several enemies within 3 meters of the caster.\n</p><p>As of Build 121, DoT effects for this skill may now stack once for each player in your group.\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> 10 Seconds.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>...a cloud that causes X Poison Damage over Y seconds on a maximum of Z enemies.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 3\n</td><td> 8\n</td><td> 13\n</td><td> 18\n</td><td> 23\n</td><td> 28\n</td><td> 33\n</td><td> 38\n</td><td> 43\n</td><td> 48\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 48-88\n</td><td> 189-351\n</td><td> 330-613.75\n</td><td> 471-876.75\n</td><td> 613-1139.75\n</td><td> 754-1402.75\n</td><td> 895-1665.5\n</td><td> 1036-1928.5\n</td><td> 1177-2191.50\n</td><td> 1318-2454.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> 4\n</td><td> 4.25\n</td><td> 4.5\n</td><td> 4.75\n</td><td> 5\n</td><td> 5.25\n</td><td> 5.5\n</td><td> 5.75\n</td><td> 6\n</td><td> 6.25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Z\n</td><td> 4\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 19.1\n</td><td> 27.6\n</td><td> 36.1\n</td><td> 44.6\n</td><td> 53.1\n</td><td> 61.6\n</td><td> 70.1\n</td><td> 78.6\n</td><td> 87.1\n</td><td> 95.6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 3340\n</td><td> 8908\n</td><td> 14476\n</td><td> 20044\n</td><td> 25613\n</td><td> 31181\n</td><td> 36749\n</td><td> 42317\n</td><td> 47885\n</td><td> 53453\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999